2026-07-27T12:03:35.1001846Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1002628Z i /tmp/RtmpnDPFyV/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1003180Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1003812Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1004406Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1005263Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1006585Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1008222Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1277288Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1383058Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1826424Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T12:03:35.1991996Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
